 "remarks": "Residence 202 at Coastal Point offers 1,660 sq. ft. of beautifully appointed living space in a boutique collection of just 12 residences, built in 2017 in central Westport. Select residences are being offered for sale for the very first time, presenting a rare opportunity to own in this sought-after community. Built by Westport's preeminent builder, Coastal Luxury Homes, to the standards of a luxury single-family home, this two-bedroom, two and a half -bathroom residence combines thoughtful design with high-end finishes and effortless living. The walk-out design creates an easy connection to its own private outdoor space, extending the living area and offering a welcome retreat for outdoor enjoyment. Inside, clean architectural lines, abundant natural light, hardwood floors, solid wood doors and custom millwork reflect the quality and attention to detail throughout. A well-appointed kitchen, in-unit laundry, air conditioning and private indoor parking add to the convenience. Beautifully landscaped grounds and attractive exterior finishes complete the setting, while shops, restaurants and everyday services are just a short walk away. Downtown Westport, the train and Long Island Sound beaches are only a short drive away. A distinctive opportunity to enjoy the comfort and quality of luxury homeownership with the ease of low-maintenance condominium living.",
